{
 "brief": "Israeli occupation forces demolished the house of Farouk Ramadan in Tel village, southwest of Nablus in the northern West Bank, on Tuesday morning, according to Shehab Wire. The structure belonged to a man identified as a martyr in Palestinian sources.\n\nThe demolition followed a military operation in which Israeli forces entered the village hours earlier. During that incursion, troops forced dozens of Palestinian families from their homes, creating a widespread displacement in the community.",
